  * Cluster peer frames carry a wire epoch.  Releases with the same
    epoch federate whatever their version numbers; a peer with a
    different one is refused at the door by both sides, with both
    numbers named.
  * New counters: stats.cluster.wire_epoch and epoch_refused, with the
    matching /metrics series.

