perfcached (0.4.0~rc2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Second candidate of the 0.4.0 line.  Fixes rc1's PSUBSCRIBE pattern
    matcher (a hostile pattern could stall a node or read past its
    buffer).  The pub/sub engine loses its global lock and gains a
